{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114835729306062849"]}, "author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:45:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114835731885502827"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Scaling Up Demand Flexibility - Analysis and key findings. A report by the International Energy Agency.", "display_url": "iea.li/44gy0yS", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://iea.li/44gy0yS", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114835775162392576/4_eCDfzE?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114835775162392576/4_eCDfzE?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 256, "status": 200, "title": "Scaling Up Demand Flexibility - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/reports/scaling-up-demand-flexibility?utm_content=buffer4ed75&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/fWJI2BVRt1"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/wtLZxDl04e", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2114835731885502827/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114835729306062849", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/wtLZxDl04e"}]}, "id": "2114835731885502827", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 848, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Demand flexibility is already helping manage periods of peak stress in power systems\n\nAnd as electrification advances, it could evolve into an everyday tool for boosting system resilience &amp; efficiency\n\nOur report looks at how to unlock these benefits: https://t.co/fWJI2BVRt1 https://t.co/wtLZxDl04e", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2114835731885502827"}, {"author_id": "17468569", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:41:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114834793296978182"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/RyanBethencour…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/RyanBethencourt/status/2114701737307087047", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/7MH1yA4Qla"}]}, "id": "2114834793296978182", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 9932, "like_count": 53, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Extends the medium lifespan of male mice by 22.5% and 35% in female mice. \n\nIt's a few years old, I posted about it in 2024.\n\nShowed IL-11 as a driver of aging, and tissue inflammation and fibrosis. It climbed up with age, and was linked to fat build up and muscle loss. \n\nIt is https://t.co/7MH1yA4Qla", "url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2114834793296978182"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114834637360881664"]}, "author_id": "166252256", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:40:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114834663352983751"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/7PYI0OYsgB", "end": 107, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2114834663352983751/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114834637360881664", "start": 84, "url": "https://t.co/7PYI0OYsgB"}]}, "id": "2114834663352983751", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1854, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "“You Can See Everything.”\n\n…Except where reliable energy was supposed to come from. https://t.co/7PYI0OYsgB", "url": "https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2114834663352983751"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114830620278812673"]}, "author_id": "17026589", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:26:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114831025419288956"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 36, "id": "5694822", "start": 26, "username": "Princeton"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Y9sYkCVkmR", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JesseJenkins/status/2114831025419288956/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114830620278812673", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/Y9sYkCVkmR"}]}, "id": "2114831025419288956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 831, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 1, "reply_